# ios/ and android/ ARE tracked: capacitor.config.ts alone doesn't carry
# custom native code (the share-target plugin, manifest entries, future
# Xcode share extension). Their own nested .gitignore files handle build
# artifacts (Pods, .gradle, DerivedData, xcuserdata, etc.) — see
# frontend/android/.gitignore and frontend/ios/.gitignore.

